            height: 14,
            decoration: BoxDecoration(
              color: colors.indigo,
              shape: BoxShape.circle,
              border: Border.all(color: colors.bg, width: 2),
            ),
            child: const Icon(
              Icons.folder_open,
              size: 8,
              color: Colors.white,
            ),
          ),
        ),
      ),
    ],
  );
}

Widget _maybeSeedErrorBadge(FahColors colors, String key, Widget tile) {
